From: lane 3 <lane3@ios-nord>
Subject: [PATCH] build: a libdrm stand-in for Darwin, and the drm layer built with it


system_has_kms_drm is false without a DRM stack, so dep_libdrm is null_dep, the -I for
<xf86drm.h> is missing and src/freedreno/drm is not even entered. Replace the dependency on
Darwin with the in-tree stand-in (src/freedreno/drm/darwin) and build its one source with the
drm layer. IOSurface is the only framework linked: an IOSurface is handed to the driver by
its ID where a buffer's descriptor would be.

The drm library also links libvdrm unconditionally, which is not built without virtio.

---
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -1716,7 +1716,17 @@
   # dependencies (such as vk-runtime) linking to it
   dep_libdrm = null_dep
 endif
-if dep_libdrm.found()
+if host_machine.system() == 'darwin' and with_gallium_freedreno
+  # No DRM on this system. freedreno's requests go to the kernel's character device through a
+  # stand-in for libdrm that is part of the drm layer (src/freedreno/drm/darwin): freedreno's
+  # <xf86drm.h> comes from here, and the one source file is built with the drm layer itself.
+  # IOSurface is the only thing linked, for the memory someone else made (an IOSurface is
+  # handed in by its ID, where a buffer's descriptor would be).
+  dep_libdrm = declare_dependency(
+    include_directories : include_directories('src/freedreno/drm/darwin'),
+    link_args : ['-framework', 'IOSurface', '-framework', 'CoreFoundation'],
+  )
+elif dep_libdrm.found()
   pre_args += '-DHAVE_LIBDRM'
   if with_dri_platform == 'drm' and with_dri
     with_gallium_drisw_kms = true

--- a/src/freedreno/meson.build
+++ b/src/freedreno/meson.build
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@
 subdir('ir3')
 subdir('fdl')
 
-if system_has_kms_drm
+if system_has_kms_drm or host_machine.system() == 'darwin'
   subdir('drm')
 endif
 

--- a/src/freedreno/drm/meson.build
+++ b/src/freedreno/drm/meson.build
@@ -46,6 +46,12 @@
 )
 libfreedreno_drm_files += libfreedreno_drm_msm_files
 
+# No DRM here: the libdrm stand-in is built into this library (see the dependency in meson.build).
+if host_machine.system() == 'darwin'
+  libfreedreno_drm_files += files('darwin/drm_darwin.c', 'darwin/xf86drm.h')
+  libfreedreno_drm_includes += include_directories('darwin')
+endif
+
 libfreedreno_drm_virtio_files = files(
   'virtio/virtio_bo.c',
   'virtio/virtio_device.c',
@@ -72,8 +78,7 @@
   c_args : [no_override_init_args, libfreedreno_drm_flags],
   gnu_symbol_visibility : 'hidden',
   dependencies : libfreedreno_drm_deps,
-  # TODO
-  link_with : [libvdrm],
+  link_with : freedreno_kmds.contains('virtio') ? [libvdrm] : [],
   build_by_default : false,
 )
 
